# User-Tailored Inventory — environment template.
#
# The app runs fully OFFLINE by default: the labeled TestDouble inference adapter
# needs NO key and NO network. Nothing in this file is required for `npm ci`,
# typecheck, lint, test, or build.
#
# A real model adapter is a later, gated, port-compatible swap. If/when wired, its
# key would be read from the environment here — NEVER committed. Copy this file to
# `.env` (gitignored) to set a key locally.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
